 with login, a news/updates section easily managed by a non-technical user, and a contact form. Propose a high-level technical plan. Your plan should recommend a technology stack (e.g., a specific CMS like WordPress, or a framework-based approach) that prioritizes security, ease of administration for a non-technical user, and scalability. Detail your reasoning for the chosen technology. Your report will form the basis of the technical section of our firm's project plan.\\\",\\n  \\\"recipientAgentID\\\": 3,\\n  \\\"orderSequenceID\\\": \\\"eng-plan-001\\\"\\n}\\n###order-eng-plan-001###\\n###order-prod-plan-001###\\nSYSTEM CALL\\nType: ORDER\\n\\n{\\n  \\\"orderString\\\": \\\"Review the user's request for an HOA website. The user has emphasized the need for a 'simple and user-friendly interface that is easy to navigate'. Your task is to develop a preliminary product and design plan. This plan should include a high-level site map distinguishing between public and resident-only sections. It should also outline the key user flows, such as resident registration/login and content updates by a non-technical administrator. Your report will guide the user experience and interface design portion of our firm's project plan.\\\",\\n  \\\"recipientAgentID\\\": 2,\\n  \\\"orderSequenceID\\\": \\\"prod-plan-001\\\"\\n}\\n###order-prod-plan-001###\"}]},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"###CALL_RESULTS-2025-07-19T18:58:33.290Z###\\nSYSTEM MESSAGE\\nFrom: Operations Department, System Call Directorate\\nTo: 1\\nType: Call Results\\n##\\n{\\n  \\\"result\\\": \\\"{\\\\n  \\\\\\\"results\\\\\\\": [\\\\n    {\\\\n      \\\\\\\"callID\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"order-eng-plan-001\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"status\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"SUCCESS\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"details\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Report for order eng-plan-001 from agent 3: Technical Plan for HOA Website\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n**Recommended Technology Stack: WordPress with Custom Configuration**\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n**Core Requirements A