icious patterns for review\\\\\\\\n   \\\\\\\\n   b) **Integration Possibilities**:\\\\\\\\n   - Google Sheets integration for maintaining approved list\\\\\\\\n   - Zapier webhooks for external verification systems\\\\\\\\n   - SMS verification as additional security layer\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n7. **Administrator Training Components:**\\\\\\\\n   \\\\\\\\n   - Video walkthrough of approval process\\\\\\\\n   - Written guide with screenshots\\\\\\\\n   - Common verification scenarios and solutions\\\\\\\\n   - Troubleshooting guide for edge cases\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n**Implementation Timeline Estimate:**\\\\\\\\n- Initial setup and configuration: 2-3 hours\\\\\\\\n- Testing and refinement: 1-2 hours\\\\\\\\n- Admin training materials: 2 hours\\\\\\\\n- Total: 5-7 hours of development time\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n**Ongoing Maintenance:**\\\\\\\\n- Admin time per registration: 2-5 minutes\\\\\\\\n- Weekly review of pending queue recommended\\\\\\\\n- Monthly audit of approved users\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n**Cost Analysis:**\\\\\\\\n- MemberPress: $179/year\\\\\\\\n- Additional security plugins: ~$50/year\\\\\\\\n- Total annual software cost: ~$230\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\nThis solution provides a secure, manageable system that doesn't require technical expertise to operate while maintaining strong verification standards for the HOA community.\\\\\\\"\\\\n    },\\\\n    {\\\\n      \\\\\\\"callID\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"order-prod-verify-002\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"status\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"SUCCESS\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"details\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Report for order prod-verify-002 from agent 2: Manual Resident Verification Workflow Design\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n**RESIDENT REGISTRATION PROCESS**\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n1. **Initial Registration Form**\\\\\\\\n   - Full Name (required)\\\\\\\\n   - Email Address (required)\\\\\\\\n   - Phone Number (required)\\\\\\\\n   - Property Address (required, with auto-complete)\\\\\\\\n   - Move-in Date (required)\\\\\\\\n   - Property Type (dropdown: owner/renter)\\\\\\\\n   -